@* What a custom agent could add for a business like the demo's (F127.1): a kicker, the heading the guide's tour reads,
   and a card a note, each with its title over its line. Each note is a piece of the page (F134.5), by its title, so a
   visitor can select it and ask the guide about it. *@
@using LouisAgent.Web.Components.Site.Pieces
<div class="demo-notes">
    <span class="notes-kicker">@Kicker</span>
    <h2 class="notes-heading">@Heading</h2>
    <ul class="notes-list">
        @foreach (var note in Notes)
        {
            <li class="note" id="@PieceId.Of(note.Title)" data-piece>
                <h3 class="note-title">@note.Title</h3>
                <span class="note-text">@note.Text</span>
            </li>
        }
    </ul>
</div>
